            "review_title": "Review at El Toro - Home for Steaks & Wines",
            "review_text": "Thomas K\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam166 contributions\n0\nGreat Steaks, Great Service, Great Value\nNov 2025 • Friends\nHad the chance to dine at this wonderful new steakhouse in Thao Dien and was genuinely impressed.\nThe design is beautiful and the whole place feels premium, yet the prices are surprisingly reasonable. The service was impeccable, the team really gives their all to make the experience smooth and enjoyable.\n\nI tried their OP Ribs, which were delicious, generous, and perfect for sharing. The set comes with starters, sauces, and desserts, making it great value.\n\nI’ll definitely be back to try more of their dishes.\nRead more\nWritten December 1, 2025",
